{"ticker":"JD","updated":"2026-10-23T23:10:54Z","profile":{"longName":"JD.com, Inc.","shortName":"JD.com, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Internet Retail","country":"China","website":"https://www.jd.com","fullTimeEmployees":900000,"marketCap":34248679424,"trailingPE":17.734266,"forwardPE":6.286144,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.026075596,"pegRatio":0.52,"targetMeanPrice":39.083515,"targetHighPrice":58.318768,"targetLowPrice":25.125813,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":35,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":-0.029,"earningsGrowth":0.213,"grossMargins":0.09421,"operatingMargins":0.01196,"profitMargins":0.01126,"totalRevenue":1313438040064,"beta":0.318,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":35.059,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":24.508,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.89},"summary":"JD.com, Inc. operates as a supply chain-based technology and service provider in the People's Republic of China and Europe. It operates through three segments: JD Retail, JD Logistics, and New Businesses. The company provides home appliances; mobile handsets and other digital products; computers, including desktop, laptop, and other various products, as well as printers and other office equipment; furniture and household goods; apparel; cosmetics and other personal care items; and pet products. It offers women's shoes, bags, watches, jewelry, and luxury goods; men's shoes, sports gear, and fitness equipment; automobiles and accessories; maternal and childcare products; toys and musical instruments; food, beverages, and fresh produce; gifts, flowers, and plants; and pharmaceutical and healthcare products, such as OCT pharmaceutical products, nutritional supplements, healthcare services, and other healthcare equipment. In addition, the company provides books, e-books, music, movies, and other media products; virtual goods consisting of online travel agency, attraction tickets, and prepaid phone cards and game cards; industrial products; and installation and maintenance services. Further, it offers online marketplace services for third-party merchants; marketing services; and omni-channel solutions to customers and offline retailers, as well as online healthcare services. Addition","summary_zh":"京東公司是一家在中華人民共和國和歐洲運營的供應鏈技術和服務提供者。它透過三個部門運作：京東零售、京東物流和新業務。本公司提供家用電器；手機及其他數位產品；計算機，包括桌上型電腦、筆記型電腦和其他各種產品，以及印表機和其他辦公設備；家具和家居用品；服飾;化妝品和其他個人護理用品；和寵物產品。它提供女鞋、箱包、手錶、珠寶和奢侈品；男鞋、運動裝備和健身器材；汽車及配件；母嬰護理用品；玩具和樂器；食品、飲料和新鮮農產品；禮品、鮮花和植物；醫藥及保健品，如OCT藥品、營養補充劑、保健服務及其他保健器材。此外，該公司還提供書籍、電子書、音樂、電影等媒體產品；包括線上旅行社、景點門票、預付費電話卡和遊戲卡在內的虛擬商品；工業產品；以及安裝和維護服務。此外，它還為第三方商家提供線上市場服務；行銷服務；為客戶和線下零售商提供全通路解決方案，以及線上醫療保健服務。添加","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"網路零售","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":32.215,"h":32.425,"l":31.985,"c":31.99,"v":9985600},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":32.1,"h":32.37,"l":31.76,"c":31.81,"v":5606200},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":30.8,"h":30.88,"l":30.551,"c":30.82,"v":16777300},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":30.13,"h":30.45,"l":29.9,"c":30.39,"v":18320600},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":30.755,"h":31.34,"l":30.5,"c":31.07,"v":18807400},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":30.55,"h":31.62,"l":30.205,"c":31.58,"v":16122200},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":31.0,"h":31.33,"l":30.866,"c":31.2,"v":9620800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":31.02,"h":31.14,"l":30.61,"c":30.93,"v":13222500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":31.39,"h":31.45,"l":30.955,"c":31.45,"v":13874900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":31.66,"h":32.87,"l":31.6,"c":32.85,"v":21711600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":33.02,"h":33.93,"l":32.75,"c":33.87,"v":27784500},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":33.87,"h":33.88,"l":33.075,"c":33.32,"v":20033900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":33.33,"h":34.46,"l":33.27,"c":34.4,"v":23508000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":34.235,"h":34.27,"l":33.61,"c":33.67,"v":20314000},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":34.21,"h":34.32,"l":33.37,"c":33.62,"v":19129600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":33.47,"h":34.94,"l":33.14,"c":34.71,"v":27885400},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":35.445,"h":35.685,"l":34.55,"c":35.24,"v":31709700},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":34.725,"h":35.575,"l":34.52,"c":35.38,"v":26354200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":35.73,"h":3